  "theorem_statement": "The fifteen foreign V4 stabilizers correspond exactly to the fifteen edges of a chamber-incidence graph isomorphic to five disjoint triangles. Every native quotient chamber belongs to one triangle and is incident with exactly two foreign V4 edges. Each edge supports eight frontier cycles, split four with relay relation b and four with relay relation ab.",
